            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Top tags like &apos;skinhead&apos;, &apos;brilliant&apos;, etc. have </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontsize='12' italic='true'>+15.16%</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'> rating lift. Bottom tag &apos;waste of time&apos; drags </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#9e3d22' fontsize='12' italic='true'>-23.98%</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'> the rating. Need to focus on acquiring movies with positive attributes, avoid negative ones.</run>
