            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Bar chart shows distribution by type. High Priority table lists top promotion candidates. Hidden Gems reflects low visibility (few raters), high quality ratings, making it a potential opportunity for marketers. </run>
